# Build and test output that was previously TRACKED. Every build rewrote tsbuildinfo and every
# pytest run rewrote .coverage, so the four files produced a dirty tree and a spurious diff on
# every machine, forever. Nothing in the Dockerfiles, cloudbuild configs or CI reads them.
*.tsbuildinfo
.coverage

# Browser-automation debug output. Only `fx/` was ignored before, which left 152 console logs
# permanently untracked-but-not-ignored — enough noise to hide a real file in `git status`.
.playwright-mcp/

# Root-level scratch: verification screenshots and portal probe dumps. Scoped to the repo root
# with a leading slash so it can never shadow a real asset under design/reference/ or
# apps/*/public/. `gem-*.json` in particular is raw GeM listing data, which must not be
# committed even to a private repo (docs/discovery/source-gem.md §8).
/*.png
/gem-*.json
